# No secrets are needed at build time.
# The Google Apps Script URL and access token are entered in the app
# (Settings -> Google Sheets) and kept in the browser, never in the repository.
#
# Optional: pre-fill the Apps Script URL field. This value is PUBLIC once built.
# Never put the access token here.
